{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the world of Unbridled: That Horse Game - a unique horse game simulator that gives you the freedom to make your own choices and shape your own destiny. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an Early Access title, we value player feedback and are actively working to expand and improve the game with your support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938050/extras/1c4a049273c7f3a6bd940a7f16a316b0.avif?t=1770648157\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938050/extras_big/1c4a049273c7f3a6bd940a7f16a316b0.avif?t=1770648157 width=800 height=155 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Horse Creator</strong>: Design your dream horse with an incredibly detailed creation system, allowing you to customize everything from coat patterns and colors to features like mane style and unique markings.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Horse Care:</strong> Groom, feed, and care for your horses through systems that are easy to learn and feel realistic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Training at the Riding School:</strong> Improve your skills on dedicated training courses designed to prepare you and your horse for future challenges or competitions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Archery on Horseback:</strong> Test your precision with dynamic horseback archery gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gardening:</strong> Grow plants, crops, horse feed, or flowers as a source of income or crafting materials.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Obstacle Course Builder:</strong> Train your horses your way by designing custom courses that suit your style and goals and share them in multiplayer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jobs:</strong> Earn money and gather resources by chopping wood, lending a hand in the stables, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Veilingen:</strong> Meet friendly NPCs and browse unique shops in the old town.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buying and Selling Horses:</strong> Acquire new horses from various sources and sell them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More Horse Breeds:</strong> Uncover rare and powerful horse breeds to strengthen and diversify your herd.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Multiplayer:</strong> Ride with other players through interactive sessions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938050/extras/8a30a2ae1e3053bd2b575482633a9593.avif?t=1770648157\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938050/extras_big/8a30a2ae1e3053bd2b575482633a9593.avif?t=1770648157 width=800 height=164 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Coming Soon to Unbridled</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Unbridled is in Early Access, which means exciting features are still in development:</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Estate Designing:</strong> Customize the look and layout of your estate to make it truly your own.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Competitions:</strong> Compete in large-scale events, including disciplines such as Show Jumping!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Horse Breeding:</strong> Breed horses <strong>like never before</strong> in a horse game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wild Animals:</strong> Encounter and interact with various wildlife species as you explore the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fishing:</strong> Enjoy the serene waters by fishing to catch a variety of species or other surprises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Western Riding</strong>: Explore a dedicated mode focused entirely on Western riding and enjoy the authentic atmosphere of this unique style.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on a one-of-a-kind adventure, live your equestrian dreams, and help shape the future of Unbridled. The journey begins now, what story will you create?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1938050?t=1770648157","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938050/63f22cd19c1f07003660ff7ddf791a442e9cb30f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770648157","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938050/454e57b274c1e18707f38f1a8c016b5f563aec48/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770648157","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938050/454e57b274c1e18707f38f1a8c016b5f563aec48/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770648157","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the world of Unbridled: That Horse Game - a unique horse game simulator that gives you the freedom to make your own choices and shape your own destiny. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an Early Access title, we value player feedback and are actively working to expand and improve the game with your support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://